(SUPPLY — PT-40 SECOND SOURCE QUALIFIED) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Kaldbakur Semiconductor hf completed qualification as a second source for the PT-40) Tj
T*
(pressure transducer die on 14 May 2026. The Kaldbakur die passed the 1,000-hour) Tj
T*
(pressure-cycling test and the salt-fog corrosion test, and a production lot of 4,000 die) Tj
T*
(was accepted on 2 July 2026.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Kaldbakur die entered shipped product on 28 July 2026. We expect Kaldbakur to supply) Tj
T*
(between 30 and 40 percent of PT-40 volume during the fourth quarter of fiscal 2026, rising) Tj
T*
(to approximately half in fiscal 2027.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The second-quarter report described the second source as identified and sampled but not) Tj
T*
(qualified, and described the resulting single-source exposure as unmitigated. That) Tj
T*
(exposure is now mitigated.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Separately, on 19 June 2026 we extended the Tessin Micro Fabrication supply agreement to) Tj
T*
(31 January 2028 on substantially the same commercial terms. We reduced PT-40 inventory) Tj
T*
(cover from eleven weeks to eight weeks in July, which released $1.1 million of working) Tj
T*
(capital.) Tj
T*
ET
